msgid "no piece left that can cross the river"
msgstr "keine Figur mehr, die den Fluss überqueren kann"

#. TRANSLATORS: Xiangqi, why the game was drawn
#: src/variants/xiangqi.js:490
msgid "50 moves by each side without a capture"
msgstr "50 Züge jeder Seite ohne Schlag"

